# Repro: semantic model points at a missing or disabled dbt model
# Copy the idea into:
#   models/marts/core/schema.yml
# in one semantic model definition
#
# Example temporary breakage pattern:
#   model: ref('definitely_missing_model')
#
# Command:
#   dbt parse --no-partial-parse
#
# Before:
#   Older runtimes could surface IndexError-style failures.
#
# After:
#   Newer dbt/Fusion should raise a clear semantic dependency / compilation
#   error saying the model is missing or disabled.
